OL,3,ANor'easter storm brings coastal
OL,4,Aflooding, as New York and New Jersey
OL,5,Adeclare emergency
OL,6,
OL,7,FTens of millions of people across the
OL,8,Fnorth-eastern US are in the path of a
OL,9,Fpowerful storm this weekend, which has
OL,10,Falready brought coastal flooding, power
OL,11,Foutages, travel chaos and cancelled
OL,12,Fstadium events.
OL,14,FPeaking on Saturday, the so-called
OL,15,Fnor'easter will "bring dangerous
OL,16,Fcoastal flooding and beach conditions,
OL,17,Fstrong winds, and heavy rainfall" to
OL,18,Fareas including New York City and
OL,19,FBoston, the US National Weather Service
OL,20,F(NWS) said.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
